        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9100/31, Vintage Collection Simple Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Simple Vintage Finish Cabinet Knob is available in 3 finishes, all of which are crafted to have the look of naturally weathered metal. The beautiful finish will be sure to add a classic look to any home. The Vintage Collection Simple Cabinet Knob is great for restoration projects. It has an authentic old world look that will blend into the look of historic home hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/simple-cabinet-knob-omnia-9100-31\"><b>Omnia 9100 Simple Cabinet Knob in Other Finishes</b></a> and  <a href=\"/products/simple-stainless-steel-cabinet-knob-omnia-9100-us32d\"><b>Omnia 9100-US32D Simple Cabinet Knob in Brushed Stainless Steel</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Simple Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-7/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
